     [EINVAL]           NULL pointer was passed in the _r_o_u_t_i_n_e argument.

     The pptthhrreeaadd__sswwiittcchh__ddeelleettee__nnpp() may fail if:

     [EINVAL]           The _r_o_u_t_i_n_e argument is different from the argument
                        previously passed to the pptthhrreeaadd__sswwiittcchh__aadddd__nnpp() func‐
                        tion.

